---
title: Chocolate Drop Cookies
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@brown sugar{1%cup}
@milk{0.5%cup}
@flour{1.5%cups}
@melted chocolate{2%squares}
@melted butter{0.5%cup}
@egg{1}
@soda{0.5%tsp}
@chopped nuts{0.5%cup}

Drop onto greased cookie sheets. Bake at 350 degrees until top of cookie springs back from touch.
